of which <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c77" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xhg:DesignatedCommonStock" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-7882">8,500,000,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shall be designated as Class A ordinary shares of a nominal or par value of US$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c79" decimals="7" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-7883">0.0000001</ix:nonFraction> each, <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c80" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xhg:DesignatedCommonStock" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-7884">1,000,000,000,000</ix:nonFraction>
shall be designated as Class B ordinary shares of a nominal or par value of US$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c81" decimals="5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="2" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-7885">0.0000001</ix:nonFraction> each, and <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c77" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xhg:DesignatedPreferredShares" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-7886">500,000,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shall be designated
as preferred shares of a nominal or par value of US$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c78" decimals="7" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-7887">0.0000001</ix:nonFraction> each, to (ii) US$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c82" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentCompanyIncreaseDecreaseFromShareTransaction" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-7888">48,000,000</ix:nonFraction> divided into <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c82" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesOther" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-7889">480,000,000,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of a
