par value of US$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c85" decimals="7" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-7892">0.0000001</ix:nonFraction> each, <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c86" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xhg:DesignatedCommonStock" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-7893">60,000,000,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shall be designated as Class B ordinary shares of a nominal or par value of US$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c87" decimals="7" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-7894">0.0000001</ix:nonFraction>
each, and <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c82" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xhg:DesignatedPreferredShares" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-7895">500,000,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shall be designated as preferred shares of a nominal or par value of US$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c83" decimals="7" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-7896">0.0000001</ix:nonFraction> each, by the creation of an
additional <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c79" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesSubscribedButUnissued" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-7897">411,000,000,000,000</ix:nonFraction> unissued Class A ordinary shares of a par value of US$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c79" decimals="7" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xhg:UnissuedCommonStockSharesParValue" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-7898">0.0000001</ix:nonFraction> each to rank pari passu in all respects
with the existing Class A ordinary shares and <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c81" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesSubscribedButUnissued" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-7899">59,000,000,000,000</ix:nonFraction> unissued Class B ordinary shares of a par value of US$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c81" decimals="7" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xhg:UnissuedCommonStockSharesParValue" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-7900">0.0000001</ix:nonFraction> each
